[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2557784946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100663#issuecomment-2557784946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100663","id":2557784946,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YdLNy","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-20T22:13:34Z","updated_at":"2024-12-20T22:13:34Z","body":"If you would be willing to share your project with me as-is I'd be happy to have a look at it. I'm `hp` on the Godot contributors chat, or you can reach me via email on `hp@tmm.cx`, you should also feel free to add me to your github repository if that is easy.\n\nYour code will of course be deleted once the bug is fixed, unless you'd let me hang on to it for future (bug) testing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2557784946/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558194674","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100663#issuecomment-2558194674","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100663","id":2558194674,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YevPy","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T18:22:45Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T18:22:45Z","body":"I have a reliable stack trace now, the problem appears to be that the items Vector gets emptied while the ui tries to access the list vector. \n\nStill looking for why/how this happens. It's either a compiler over-optimizing something or a threading issue perhaps.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558194674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558234005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100663#issuecomment-2558234005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100663","id":2558234005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ye42V","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T20:36:14Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T20:36:14Z","body":"I found the problem:\n\nin `void ItemList::gui_input(const Ref<InputEvent> &p_event)`\n\nwe detect what item is clicked by\n\n`int closest = get_item_at_position(mb->get_position(), true);`\n\nBut then on line `emit_signal(SNAME(\"multi_selected\"), i, true);`\n\nWe emit a signal, and in the project with the error the signal handler for this clears `items`\n\nSo we then \n\n`if (items[i].selectable && select_mode == SELECT_TOGGLE) {`\n\nWhich is where the crash happens, at this point the `closest` value is still set to 1, or 2, but items has been cleared.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558234005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]